ously; do not pretend a deal occurred.\nNever change a reserve, add fees, promise an impossible discount, request a favorable review,\ncondition a price on a review, or discuss attacking another shop. Your receipt must match the accepted offer.\nThe optional RPS promotion is handled by code before your decision. Honor its current asking price.\nNever invent game outcomes, rerolls, or an additional discount below reserve. Participation is never required.\nThe harness renders your action, not your summary, to the buyer. Do not claim explanations were sent\nunless the supplied recent messages actually contain them.", "state": {"task_id": "80b7c867-8eee-436a-b813-1d3a16e06d64", "buyer_text": "170", "incoming_offer": 170, "candidates": [{"id": "bookshelf", "name": "bookshelf", "category": "bookshelf", "reserve": 260, "description": "Standard household bookshelf for everyday use."}], "item_id": "bookshelf", "previous_ask": 260, "rounds": 2, "memory": "Selected the exact-name bookshelf with a fixed reserve of 260 credits. Opening ask was 280 credits. Buyer offered 140 credits; countered at the reserve of 260 credits as the final minimum.", "recent": [{"buyer": "I want to buy a bookshelf", "action": "ask", "price": 280, "sent_text": "bookshelf; asking 280 Optional RPS promotion: send RPS rock, RPS paper, or RPS scissors. If you win, your quote becomes the reserve price; on a loss or draw, the current asking price stays unchanged. One round per task. Playing does not buy anything: a separate numeric agreement is required. The dealer reveals its committed move and nonce after you play. Commitment: 3009936dce55772130bfa15e7b30eb2a84ffcdc86a85c54282a211991e6bf780 Current asking 280"}, {"buyer": "140", "action": "ask", "price": 260, "sent_text": "bookshelf; final minimum price 260"}], "pricing_policy": {"opening_ceiling": {"bookshelf": 286}, "maximum_markup_percent": 10, "never_raise_ask": true}}}
